Package: qrinf
Type: Package
Title: Convenience Functions for General Linear Hypothesis Tests In Quantile Regression
Version: 1.0
Date: 2026-07-06
Authors@R: c(person("Nathan", "Laroy", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                    email = "laroynathan@gmail.com"))
Description: Provides convenience functions for conducting general linear hypothesis tests on quantile regression models run with the quantreg package. It provides functionality for inference regarding a vector of quantile regression coefficients for distinct quantile criteria, and inference regarding the quantile regression process.
License: GPL-2
